:: Deadwood Street Landry Offer
<<deadwood-street-story-header 'landry' 0 'smuggler'>>
<<if !_storyPageUnavailable>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-street-landry-offer'>>
    <<set _landryStory to maplebirch.get('StreetLife').stories.state.landry>>
    <<if _landryStory.stage is 0>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Landry has kept the table behind the partition for your meeting. A folded delivery note lies beneath an empty glass. <<nnpc_He 'Landry'>> moves the glass and lays two more slips beside it. The same shipment appears on all three, but the charges do not agree.<br><br>
          "A few crates of machine parts. They've reached a warehouse in the industrial district, and now someone wants another forty pounds before letting the last crate go." Landry taps the harbour receipt. "Start at the docks. Check what was actually handed over, then take that to the warehouse. Bring the two people you've hired. One can check the details while the other keeps an eye on the goods."<br><br>
          <<nnpc_He 'Landry'>> slides the papers towards you. "A hundred and eighty if the whole delivery is settled. Eighty if we have to send the disputed part back. Don't start a fight over it. I need the parts and a receipt, not a story everyone in the street can tell."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          兰德里按约在隔板后的桌边等你。一张折起的送货单压在空杯子下面。<<nnpc_He 'Landry'>>挪开杯子，又在旁边放下两张票据。三张写的是同一批货，收的费用却对不上。<br><br>
          “几箱机件，已经送到工业区的仓库。现在有人要再收四十镑，才肯放最后一箱。”兰德里点点码头的收条。“先去码头，查清交出去的是什么，再带着单子去仓库。叫上你雇的那两个人。一个核对细节，一个看着货。”<br><br>
          <<nnpc_He 'Landry'>>把纸推过来。“全部交接清楚，一百八十镑。有争议的那部分只能退回去，就给八十。别为这点事打起来。我想要的是机件和收条，不是街上人人都会讲的故事。”
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'landry' 'accept'>>
    <<elseif _landryStory.stage is 4>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The delivery notes are no longer on Landry's table. <<nnpc_He 'Landry'>> has filed them with the other settled accounts.<br><br>
          "That one's finished," <<nnpc_he 'Landry'>> says when you mention the crates. "Whatever we do next, we start with a new agreement."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          那几张送货单已经不在桌上了。兰德里把它们收进了结清的账目里。<br><br>
          你提起那批货，<<nnpc_he 'Landry'>>点点头。“那单已经完了。接下来要办别的，就重新谈条件。”
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'landry'>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Landry puts the copy of the delivery note aside. "You've got the details. Bring back what you can actually confirm. If you need different hands, come back here and put the arrangement on hold before you change the crew." Someone passes the partition, and <<nnpc_he 'Landry'>> waits for their footsteps to fade before returning to the accounts.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          兰德里把留下的送货单副本放到一旁。“事情都写清楚了。回来时，告诉我查实了什么。要换人手，就先回这里把这单搁一搁，再重新安排。”有人从隔板外走过，<<nnpc_he 'Landry'>>等脚步声远去，才重新看起账来。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'landry'>>
    <</if>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-street-story-leave 'smuggler'>>

:: Deadwood Street Landry Docks
<<deadwood-street-story-header 'landry' 1 'docks'>>
<<if !_storyPageUnavailable>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-street-landry-docks'>>
    <<set _landryStory to maplebirch.get('StreetLife').stories.state.landry>>
    <<if _landryStory.stage is 1>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A clerk finds the shipment in a clipboard thick with carbon copies. Behind the desk, scraps of packing paper cling to an empty pallet. You set Landry's note beside the harbour copy while <<= _landryStory.crew.map(key => $per_npc[key].name).join(' and ')>> wait clear of the passing trolleys.<br><br>
          "We sent the full load," the clerk says. "The warehouse signed for it." A finger follows the lines down the page, then stops at the handling charge. The figures have been copied through more than once. Beside the pallet, one of the discarded seals still has the consignment number on it.<br><br>
          You could work through the figures and signatures, or compare the numbered seals with the packing list. The warehouse will want something firmer than your word before giving up the extra charge.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          一名文员从厚厚的复写单里找出那批货的记录。桌子后面，空托盘上还挂着几片包装纸。你把兰德里的单据放在码头副本旁边，<<= _landryStory.crew.map(key => $per_npc[key].name).join('、')>>则站到来往板车碰不到的地方。<br><br>
          “整批都发出去了。仓库签过字。”文员的手指沿着表格往下划，在装卸费那一栏停住。上面的数字被反复誊写过。托盘旁边还有一枚丢下的封签，货号仍看得清。<br><br>
          你可以逐项核算金额和签收记录，也可以拿封签与装箱单核对。想让仓库撤掉多收的费用，总得带点比口头说法更扎实的东西过去。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'landry' 'tally'>>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'landry' 'seals'>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The clerk has put the harbour copy back on the clipboard. Your notes are folded with Landry's delivery slip; there is nothing more to collect from the empty pallet.<br><br>
          Trolleys keep rattling past the desk. <<if _landryStory.stage is 2>>The dispute still has to be dealt with at the warehouse in the industrial district.<<else>>The account of your visit is already with the other papers. There is nothing else to check here.<</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          文员把码头副本夹了回去。你记下的情况和兰德里的送货单折在一起，空托盘上已经没有别的东西可查。<br><br>
          板车仍在桌旁哐啷哐啷地经过。<<if _landryStory.stage is 2>>那笔有争议的费用，还得去工业区的仓库解决。<<else>>这趟查到的情况已经记在其他票据里，这里没有别的东西要核对了。<</if>>
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'landry'>>
    <</if>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-street-story-leave 'docks'>>

:: Deadwood Street Landry Alley
<<deadwood-street-story-header 'landry' 2 'alley'>>
<<if !_storyPageUnavailable>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-street-landry-alley'>>
    <<set _landryStory to maplebirch.get('StreetLife').stories.state.landry>>
    <<if _landryStory.stage is 2>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          The loading door stands half open. Inside, the machine parts are stacked beside a trolley, with the disputed crate kept apart. A warehouse worker rests a hand on it while you lay out the papers from the docks.<br><br>
          <<if _landryStory.result is 'success'>>
            You can point to where the warehouse record disagrees with the harbour copy. The worker reads the marked lines twice. "I'd still have to clear this with someone."
          <<elseif _landryStory.result is 'setback'>>
            You have enough to follow the shipment, but nothing that settles the extra charge. The worker pushes the invoice back. "That's what it says here. Forty pounds."
          <<else>>
            Your notes are still beside the invoice. The last interruption did not settle the charge, and the worker is waiting to hear what you intend to do.
          <</if>>
          Behind you, <<= _landryStory.crew.map(key => $per_npc[key].name).join(' and ')>> keep the passage clear rather than crowding the doorway.<br><br>
          You can try to get the charge withdrawn. If that fails, the disputed part will not go through. Paying the forty pounds yourself would keep the delivery whole; returning the disputed crate would settle the matter for the smaller fee Landry offered.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          装货门开着一半。机件堆在里面的板车旁，有争议的那箱单独放着。你摊开码头带来的单据，一名仓库工人把手按在那箱货上。<br><br>
          <<if _landryStory.result is 'success'>>
            你能指出仓库记录与码头副本对不上的地方。工人把标出的几行看了两遍。“这事还得问一下。”
          <<elseif _landryStory.result is 'setback'>>
            现有记录能让你理清货物的去向，却没法证实这笔加收费用有错。工人把发票推回来。“单子上就这么写的。四十镑。”
          <<else>>
            你记下的情况还放在发票旁。先前的打断没有解决费用，工人仍在等你决定怎么做。
          <</if>>
          你身后，<<= _landryStory.crew.map(key => $per_npc[key].name).join('、')>>让开了通道，没有一齐挤在门口。<br><br>
          你可以试着让对方撤掉这笔费用，谈不拢，那部分货就不能照常交出。也可以自己付四十镑，让整批货顺利交接。或者退回有争议的那箱，按兰德里说好的较低报酬收尾。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'landry' 'negotiate'>>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'landry' 'cover'>>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'landry' 'return'>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _landryStory.choice is 'cover'>>
            The extra payment has been written on the receipt. The worker removes the hold on the last crate and places it with the rest of the delivery.
          <<elseif _landryStory.choice is 'return'>>
            The disputed crate has been marked for return. The worker signs for the rest, leaving the smaller delivery and its paperwork in order.
          <<elseif _landryStory.outcome is 'settled'>>
            The worker crosses out the extra charge and signs beside the correction. The last crate joins the others on the trolley.
          <<else>>
            The extra charge remains on the warehouse copy. The disputed crate is set aside for return, and the worker signs for the smaller delivery.
          <</if>><br><br>
          <<if _landryStory.stage is 3>>You fold the receipt with the other papers. Landry is waiting for the account at the smugglers' pub.<<else>>The warehouse has filed its copy of the receipt. There is no further decision to make at this doorway.<</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _landryStory.choice is 'cover'>>
            额外付款已经写在收条上。工人撤掉最后一箱货的扣留标记，把它放回整批货里。
          <<elseif _landryStory.choice is 'return'>>
            有争议的那箱已经标作退回。工人签收其余货物，少了一箱的交货单也核对清楚了。
          <<elseif _landryStory.outcome is 'settled'>>
            工人划掉额外费用，在改动旁签了字。最后一箱货也搬到了板车上。
          <<else>>
            仓库副本上的额外收费没能撤掉。有争议的那箱留作退回，工人为其余货物签收。
          <</if>><br><br>
          <<if _landryStory.stage is 3>>你把收条和其他票据叠好。兰德里还在走私者酒馆等你回去交账。<<else>>仓库已经收好了自己的那份收条。门口没有别的决定要做了。<</if>>
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'landry'>>
    <</if>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-street-story-leave 'alley'>>

:: Deadwood Street Landry Debrief
<<deadwood-street-story-header 'landry' 3 'smuggler'>>
<<if !_storyPageUnavailable>>
  <<deadwood-dynamicblock 'deadwood-street-landry-debrief'>>
    <<set _landryStory to maplebirch.get('StreetLife').stories.state.landry>>
    <<if _landryStory.stage is 3>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Landry clears a dry space on the table for the receipts. <<nnpc_He 'Landry'>> checks the signatures, follows the figures with a thumbnail, then looks from you to the people who came with you.<br><br>
          <<if _landryStory.choice is 'cover'>>
            "You paid the difference?" <<nnpc_He 'Landry'>> pauses at the extra line. "Write it down, then. Your money went into this as well." The full delivery is recorded, with your forty pounds still among the costs.
          <<elseif _landryStory.outcome is 'settled'>>
            "There it is." <<nnpc_He 'Landry'>> taps the corrected charge. "Much cheaper to make them read their own paperwork." The full delivery is recorded beside the agreed fee.
          <<else>>
            "A crate back, and no argument left hanging." <<nnpc_He 'Landry'>> checks the return mark. "Not what I hoped for, but I can settle that." The reduced fee goes beside the smaller delivery.
          <</if>><br><br>
          Landry sets the papers in a neat pile. "Before I close this: anything missing from that account?" <<nnpc_He 'Landry'>> waits while you and the others check it one last time.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          兰德里在桌上腾出一块干燥的地方，让你放收条。<<nnpc_He 'Landry'>>检查签名，用拇指指甲沿着金额往下比，又看看你和一同回来的人。<br><br>
          <<if _landryStory.choice is 'cover'>>
            “差额是你付的？”<<nnpc_He 'Landry'>>在多出的一行旁停住。“那也写上。这单里有你自己的钱。”整批交货记在账上，你掏出的四十镑也仍列在支出里。
          <<elseif _landryStory.outcome is 'settled'>>
            “这就对了。”<<nnpc_He 'Landry'>>点点改过的费用。“让他们看清自己写的东西，便宜多了。”整批交货的记录旁，写着先前谈好的报酬。
          <<else>>
            “退回一箱，没留下什么争执。”<<nnpc_He 'Landry'>>核对着退货标记。“跟我想的不一样，不过这样也能结账。”较低的报酬写在缩减的交货记录旁。
          <</if>><br><br>
          兰德里把票据叠整齐。“结清之前，还有没有漏写的？”<<nnpc_He 'Landry'>>等着你和同行的人再核对一遍。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-choice 'landry' 'settle'>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Landry has put away the delivery notes. <<if _landryStory.outcome is 'settled'>>The full consignment is accounted for.<<else>>The returned crate and the reduced fee are both recorded.<</if>><br><br>
          "We're square," <<nnpc_he 'Landry'>> says. The edge of another paper shows beneath the closed folder, but <<nnpc_he 'Landry'>> leaves it there for now.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          兰德里已经收起了送货单。<<if _landryStory.outcome is 'settled'>>整批货物都已交代清楚。<<else>>退回的货箱与减少的报酬，也都写在账里。<</if>><br><br>
          “这笔清了。”<<nnpc_he 'Landry'>>说道。合起的文件夹下还露着另一张纸的边角，<<nnpc_he 'Landry'>>暂时没有拿出来。
      <</language>><br><br>
      <<deadwood-street-story-result 'landry'>>
    <</if>>
  <</deadwood-dynamicblock>>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-street-story-leave 'smuggler'>>
